' ZapIF — Diagram Index
'
' Each diagram lives in its own file to make it easier to read
' and render individually:
'
'   caso_de_uso.puml      → Use Case Diagram
'   diagrama_classes.puml → Class Diagram (with packages)
'   diagrama_pacotes.puml → Package and Architecture Diagram
